  "notes": [
    {
      "section": "A",
      "text": "12 MHz crystal Y1 with C1, C2 load caps and R7 series resistor on XOUT. XIN and XOUT link to U1 on sheet Core by net labels."
    },
    {
      "section": "B",
      "text": "Every IOVDD pin has its own 100nF; C9 on DVDD, C12 1uF on VREG_VOUT. +3V3 and +1V1 link to U1 on sheet Core by net labels."
